# Chat
Every thread you can read, down the side, and the one you picked, live:  a message shows on everyone's open page at once.
Where they're kept is in OrgChat.api.spell, and only its first two lines know.
Everyone in the org reads and writes a team's open thread;  you delete your own messages, and the team's Managers anyone's.


## A row for each:  who sent it, when, and what it says

<spell-more-of "message">
	<draw>
		<segment class="message">
			<stack spacing="xs">
				<stack direction="horizontal" spacing="md" align="center" wrap>
					<text class="by">{its by}</text>
					<text class="sent" color="grey">{its sent}</text>
					<button class="remove" icon="close" size="mini" appearance="transparent" aria-label="Delete this message" title="Delete this message:  yours, or anyone's if you manage the space" onClick={remove it from the messages}/>
				</stack>
				<text class="text">{its text}</text>
			</stack>
		</segment>
	</draw>
</spell-more-of>


## The page:  the threads down the side, the one picked, oldest first, and a line to write in

<spell-app "chat page">
	<property "new message">a new message</>
	<property "picked">the first thread in every thread where its current</>

	<action "send it">
		set the sent of the new message to a new date
		set the thread of the new message to the topic of its picked
		add the new message to the messages
		set its new message to a new message
	</action>

	<draw>
		<container class="chat">
			<stack direction="horizontal" spacing="lg" align="start">
				<list class="threads" appearance="link" aria-label="Threads">
					<for thread in every thread sorted by its name a-z loading="Finding your threads">
						<item link={its link} selected={its current}>
							<stack spacing="none">
								<text class="name">{its name}</text>
								<text class="side" color="grey" size="small">{its side}</text>
							</stack>
						</item>
						<empty><text class="none" color="grey">No threads you can read.</text></empty>
						<failed><text color="red">We can't find your threads right now.</text></failed>
					</for>
				</list>
				<if its picked>
					<stack>
						<header size="large">{the name of its picked}</header>
						<stack class="message-list" spacing="sm">
							<for message in every message where its thread is the topic of the picked of the chat page sorted by its sent loading="Joining the thread">
								<message/>
								<empty><text class="none" color="grey">Nothing yet:  say hello.</text></empty>
								<failed><text color="red">We can't join this thread right now.</text></failed>
							</for>
						</stack>
						<form value={its new message}>
							<input name="text" placeholder="Write to the thread" aria-label="Your message" fluid action>
								<button slot="action" class="send" color="primary" disabled={the text of the new message is ""} onClick={send it}>Send</button>
							</input>
						</form>
					</stack>
				</if>
			</stack>
		</container>
	</draw>
</spell-app>
